msgctxt "80"
msgid "Nakahara-san... Take good care of my son."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "It would be my honor. Please leave him to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Mikio..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Sir, I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "You should be proud of your father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "I am. And I'm proud of Patriarch Nakahara, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "You got 10,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Nakahara! Are you okay!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Kiryu, Mikio, I owe you one. Those thugs would've never\r\n"
"gotten past me if I hadn't been injured."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Hey, Pops! We got the ledgers back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Okay, I'll take them. But don't expect me to say thank you\r\n"
"to a yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Give it a rest, Pops. This has nothing to do with me\r\n"
"being yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"I did this because I'm your son. We're family, right?\r\n"
"What son wouldn't help his parents?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Mikio..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Aragaki-san. Mikio can make his own decisions. You can't\r\n"
"keep treating him like a child."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Anyway, Boss... What were you doin' here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Hrm... I was..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Nakahara-san came all the way over here for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Aragaki-san, don't⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"He won't understand if I don't tell him. Nakahara-san came\r\n"
"here, bowed his head, and said..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "\"Whatever happens, please let it be Mikio's decision.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"I know a yakuza like me doesn't have the right\r\n"
"to say this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"But I want you to let Mikio make his own choices.\r\n"
"Please allow him this, Aragaki-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Nakahara-san... Why do you care about Mikio so much?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Isn't it natural for a father to worry about his children?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Pops..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "People should choose their own paths."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "Mikio, you've met a fine man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "I know."
msgstr ""

